    "note": "A **lesson** is one period of teaching, often for one person or a small group: *a piano lesson*. A **class** can be that period or the group of students: *a math class*. A **course** is a whole series of lessons on a subject: *a three-month course*. American English often uses **class** for all three: *take a class*."
  },
